# Narrow replacements for the three remote lists that route through a proxy in Hong Kong.
# Reviewed 2026-09-10; see docs/rule-sources.md for pins, exclusions, and limits.
# Claude: omit the shared Fathom analytics CDN.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,🧠 Claude
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai,🧠 Claude
# Google AI: no shared apis.google.com or unbounded domain keywords.
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN,makersuite.google.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativeai.google,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN,colab.research.google.com,💎 Google AI
DOMAIN,aistudio.google.com,💎 Google AI
